# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#   Header: max 72 chars, lowercase imperative ("add", "fix"), no trailing period.
#   Types : feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
#   Scopes: backend web api db config ci deps dev docs tests release repo   (optional)
#   Breaking change: add "!" after the type/scope, e.g. feat(api)!: ...
#
# Body (REQUIRED for feat, fix, perf, refactor; optional otherwise). Leave a blank line after the header.
# Explain WHY the change is needed and anything non-obvious about HOW. Wrap at ~100 chars.
#
# Footers (optional, one per line, after a blank line):
#   Refs: #123
#   Fixes: #123
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>   (required when the header has "!")
#
# Do NOT add "Co-Authored-By: <AI tool>", "Generated with ..." or similar attribution lines.
